title: Go to Württemberg
new-page: true
is-special: true
face-image: img/land/Württemberg.svg.webp
on-arrival: {!
  setTimeout(function() {
    var el = document.getElementById('wurttemberg');
    if (!el || typeof d3 === 'undefined' || !window.ParliamentData) return;
    el.removeAttribute('data-parliament');
    el.innerHTML = '';
    window.ParliamentData.renderParliament('wurttemberg', el);
  }, 0);
!}

= Württemberg

Historically Württemberg has always been an odd state while the population is largely protestant with large influences of Pietistic Lutheranism, the rulers have been Catholic and bouncing between French, Prussian and Austrian influences.

During the November Revolution the SPD has enterred a coalition government with the USPD that was expanded to include the other Republican parties.

Currently ruled by [+ wurttemberg_mp +] ([+ wurttemberg_mp_party +]) in a [+ wurttemberg_gov +]-Coalition with [+ wurttemberg_coalition_r +]% support.


<div id="wurttemberg" style="width:500px; height:250px;"></div>






- @coalition_wurttemberg: Coalition
- @toleration_wurttemberg: Toleration
- @policies_wurttemberg: Policies
- @states: Exit Württemberg


@coalition_wurttemberg
choose-if: wurttemberg_spd == 1
unavailable-subtitle: We are not part of the Coalition

@toleration_wurttemberg
choose-if: wurttemberg_spd == 2
unavailable-subtitle: We are not in toleration

- @withdraw_toleration: Withdraw Toleration
- @make_demand: Make a demand

@withdraw_toleration
on-arrival: wurttemberg_spd = 0; z_relation -= 2

The Center party doesn't care

@make_demand

HAHAHA, you can't make demands.

@policies_wurttemberg
choose-if: wurttemberg_spd == 1 and wurttemberg_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if not wurttemberg_spd == 1: We are not part of the Coalition. ?][? if wurttemberg_spd == 1 and wurttemberg_action_timer > 0: We have to wait [+ wurttemberg_action_timer +] months before our next action. ?]


- @reform_the_administration
- @enforce_eight_hours
- @enforce_eight_years
- @give_tax_breaks_to_local_buisnesses


@reform_the_administration
title: Reform the administration of Württemberg
on-arrival: wurttemberg_reform += 1; wurttemberg_action_timer += 7
choose-if: not wurttemberg_z == 1
unavailable-subtitle: The Zentrum thinks the admin is fine
go-to: wurttemberg_state

@enforce_eight_hours
title: Enforce the eight hour workday
on-arrival: working_day += 0.2; dvp_relation -= 4; workers_spd += 2; wurttemberg_action_timer += 8
choose-if: not wurttemberg_z == 1
unavailable-subtitle: The Zentrum thinks the workday is fine
go-to: wurttemberg_state

@enforce_eight_years
title: Establish a generally binding eighth year of school
on-arrival: z_relation -= 3; dvp_relation -= 4; unemployed_spd += 1; new_middle_spd += 1; wurttemberg_action_timer += 13
choose-if: not wurttemberg_z == 1
unavailable-subtitle: The Zentrum thinks the school is fine
go-to: wurttemberg_state

  
  
@give_tax_breaks_to_local_buisnesses
title: Give tax breaks to local buisnesses
on-arrival: ddp_relation += 3; z_relation += 3; old_middle_spd += 2; workers_spd -= 1; wurttemberg_action_timer += 9
choose-if: not (wurttemberg_gov == "Social-Democratic" or wurttemberg_gov == "Left")
go-to: wurttemberg_state

  
